# Agent workflow

- **Stop Vite before editing.** Kill the dev server (port 4721) before making code changes so HMR/reload does not slow the machine. Start it again when the human needs to playtest.
- **Do not commit or push** unless Dave explicitly asks.
- **Headless tests only.** Do not automate UI/browser testing; the human playtests the game.
